{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把所有初始腐烂橘子同时加入队列，按层向四个方向扩散；同一层代表同一分钟，因此这是多源 BFS。示例 1 中腐烂范围逐分钟扩大，最后一个新鲜橘子在第 4 分钟腐烂。遍历结束后若仍有新鲜橘子则返回 -1；初始就没有新鲜橘子则返回 0。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>腐烂的橘子：多源 BFS</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.status-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.minute{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:11px}\n.minute span{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.status{line-height:1.45;font-size:11px}\n.layout{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,38px);gap:4px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:2px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.cell .value{font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell .label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;line-height:1.2}\n.cell.empty{background:#252526;border-color:#3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell.fresh{background:#2d2d2d;border-color:#8d8d8d;color:#d4d4d4}\n.cell.rotten,.cell.newly{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.newly{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}\n.explain{flex:1 1 160px;min-width:0}\n.queue-title{margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.queue{min-height:32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;padding:6px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d}\n.token{padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px}\n.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;font-size:11px}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:inline-block;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.dot.fresh{background:#2d2d2d}.dot.rotten{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.dot.empty{background:#252526}\n.cases{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.case{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}\n.case strong{color:#3794ff}\n.case .result{margin-top:4px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>多源 BFS 同时扩散</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 1：每层 = 一分钟。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status-row\">\n<div class=\"minute\">第 <span id=\"minute\">0</span> 分钟</div>\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">收集所有初始腐烂橘子，作为多源起点。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<div class=\"grid-wrap\"><div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\" aria-label=\"橘子网格\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"explain\">\n<div class=\"queue-title\">本分钟队列</div>\n<div class=\"queue\" id=\"queue\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\" id=\"rule\">从队列腐烂格四向感染新鲜橘子。</div>\n<div class=\"legend\">\n<div><span class=\"dot rotten\"></span>腐烂</div>\n<div><span class=\"dot fresh\"></span>新鲜</div>\n<div><span class=\"dot empty\"></span>空</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cases\">\n<div class=\"case\"><strong>最小时间</strong> BFS 按层推进，首次感染即最少分钟。</div>\n<div class=\"case\"><strong>示例 2</strong> <span class=\"mono\">[[2,1,1],[0,1,1],[1,0,1]]</span> 左下橘子不可达。<div class=\"result\">-1</div></div>\n<div class=\"case\"><strong>示例 3 [[0,2]]</strong> 无新鲜。<div class=\"result\">0</div></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const original = [[2,1,1],[1,1,0],[0,1,1]];\n  const rottenAt = original.map(row=>row.map(()=>-1));\n  const frontiers = [[]];\n  original.forEach((row,r)=>row.forEach((v,c)=>{if(v===2){rottenAt[r][c]=0;frontiers[0].push([r,c]);}}));\n  for(let minute=0;frontiers[minute].length;minute++){\n    const next=[];\n    frontiers[minute].forEach(([r,c])=>[[1,0],[-1,0],[0,1],[0,-1]].forEach(([dr,dc])=>{\n      const nr=r+dr,nc=c+dc;\n      if(original[nr]?.[nc]===1&&rottenAt[nr][nc]===-1){rottenAt[nr][nc]=minute+1;next.push([nr,nc]);}\n    }));\n    if(!next.length)break;frontiers.push(next);\n  }\n  const messages = [\n    '收集所有初始腐烂橘子，作为多源起点。',\n    '处理第 0 层后，两个相邻新鲜橘子同时腐烂。',\n    '继续处理整层；同一分钟内的扩散不能重复增加时间。',\n    '腐烂范围沿可达的新鲜橘子继续向外推进。',\n    '最后一个新鲜橘子腐烂，答案为 4。'\n  ];\n  const rules = [\n    '初始化：统计新鲜橘子，并把所有值为 2 的格子同时入队。',\n    '完成一层扩散后，分钟数加 1；新腐烂的格子组成下一层。',\n    '每个新鲜橘子只入队一次，因此不会重复处理。',\n    '空格不能经过，扩散也不能走对角线。',\n    '队列结束且新鲜数为 0，所以返回当前分钟数 4。'\n  ];\n  const gridEl = document.getElementById('grid');\n  const queueEl = document.getElementById('queue');\n  const minuteEl = document.getElementById('minute');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const ruleEl = document.getElementById('rule');\n\n  function render(step) {\n    gridEl.innerHTML = '';\n    for (let r = 0; r < 3; r++) {\n      for (let c = 0; c < 3; c++) {\n        const cell = document.createElement('div');\n        const value = original[r][c];\n        const time = rottenAt[r][c];\n        const isNew = time === step && step > 0;\n        let shown = value;\n        let kind = 'empty';\n        let label = '空';\n        if (value !== 0) {\n          if (time <= step) { shown = 2; kind = 'rotten'; label = isNew ? '新腐' : '腐'; }\n          else { shown = 1; kind = 'fresh'; label = '鲜'; }\n        }\n        cell.className = 'cell ' + kind + (isNew ? ' newly' : '');\n        cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + shown + '</div><div class=\"label\">(' + r + ',' + c + ')</div>';\n        gridEl.appendChild(cell);\n      }\n    }\n    queueEl.innerHTML = '';\n    frontiers[step].forEach(function (p) {\n      const token = document.createElement('span');\n      token.className = 'token';\n      token.textContent = '(' + p[0] + ',' + p[1] + ')';\n      queueEl.appendChild(token);\n    });\n    minuteEl.textContent = step;\n    statusEl.textContent = messages[step];\n    ruleEl.textContent = rules[step];\n  }\n\n  let step = 0;\n  render(step);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    step = (step + 1) % frontiers.length;\n    render(step);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
